  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "計算機概論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO  COMPUTER AND COMPUTING",
    "describe_ch": "本課程著重於數學與計算機科學結合應用之一般性介紹，並透過Python程式搭配Anaconda進行實作，讓同學了解並銜接往後的應用數學相關課程，同時也契合CDIO之精神。此外，本課程亦融入APP應用，開發簡易且實用的Line Bot。",
    "describe_eh": "This course introduces the combined application of Mathematics and Computer Science. The implementation with Python and Anaconda facilities students to understand and connect advanced mathematic courses in the department. The course design is compatible with the CDIO principle. Moreover, this course introduces APP application and develops a simple Line Bot.",
